# Defect 355, panel 192's R7, 2026-10-05: `heroes test` prints a failing
# test's title as its source spells it, so a character a line cannot show
# reaches the runner's output by its code, `\u{1b}`, and never as itself: a
# title holding one written raw is refused before any test runs (defects 251
# and 283).

test "a title holding \u{1b}[2J and \u{202e} here"
    assert 1 == 2

function main()
    print(1)
